>You create enough food to feed six Medium creatures for a day. This food is bland and unappealing, but it is nourishing. After 1 day, if no one has eaten the food, it decays and becomes inedible. Most Small creatures eat one-quarter as much as a Medium creature (one-sixteenth as much for most Tiny creatures), and most Large creatures eat 10 times as much (100 times as much for Huge creatures and so on).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> You can feed 12 Medium creatures.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can feed 50 Medium creatures.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> You can feed 200 Medium creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"create-food","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1 hour"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"6mqK187w3a7ok1TL","heightenedLevel":6},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.Mt6ZzkVX8Q4xigFq","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"DCqyM2xjhulMW9nR"},{"folder":"iDjm2cXyRAe4VZ35","img":"icons/magic/fire/explosion-flame-blue.webp","name":"Control Water","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>By imposing your will upon the water, you can raise or lower the level of water in the chosen area by 10 feet. Creatures that have the water trait and that are in the area when you Cast the Spell must attempt a Fortitude save, with the effects of the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.WsUwpfmhKrKwoIe3]{Slow} spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Area</strong> 50 feet long by 50 feet wide</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"control-water","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","water"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"500 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"6mqK187w3a7ok1TL","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spells.Item.zfn5RqAdF63neqpP","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"6BRkQA1AlUP59J4m"},{"folder":"wnvibtD90h7CStDC","img":"icons/magic/light/projectiles-salvo-blue.webp","name":"Downpour (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You call forth a torrential downpour, which extinguishes non-magical flames. Creatures in the area are @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} and gain fire resistance 10. Creatures outside the area are Concealed to those inside the area. If a creature with weakness to water ends its turn in the area, the downpour triggers its weakness.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spell-effects.Item.LMXxICrByo7XZ3Q3]{Spell Effect: Downpour}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The fire resistance increases by 2.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"downpour","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cleric","concentrate","manipulate","water"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":30},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"6mqK187w3a7ok1TL","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spells.Item.K4LXpaBWrGy6jIER","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"RcYHvhuDflsvTj0v"},{"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"icons/magic/nature/leaf-glow-maple-teal.webp","name":"Cleanse Cuisine (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You transform all food and beverages in the area into delicious fare, changing water into wine or another fine beverage, or enhancing the food's taste and ingredients to make it a gourmet treat. You can also choose to remove all toxins and contaminations from the food. This spell doesn't prevent future contamination, natural decay, or spoilage, nor does it make the food any more nutritious.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> Add another cubic foot to the area, which must be contiguous with the rest.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"cleanse-cuisine","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 cubic foot"},"range":{"value":"10 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"6mqK187w3a7ok1TL","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.qXTB7Ec9yYh5JPPV","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"cvTJ7M7N8Q2wNL17"},{"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"icons/magic/water/wave-water-blue.webp","name":"Water Walk (Constant)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target can walk on the surface of water and other liquids without falling through. It can go underwater if it wishes, but in that case it must Swim normally. This spell doesn't grant the ability to breathe underwater.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell's range increases to 30 feet, the duration increases to 1 hour, and you can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"water-walk","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","water"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"6mqK187w3a7ok1TL","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"4":{"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.Seaah9amXg70RKw2","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"BUfOug4eJc1ze8Nw"},{"folder":"6JF73zNhT8zbp1qC","img":"icons/environment/wilderness/tree-spruce.webp","name":"Plant Growth (Rice Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Area</strong> 1/2-mile-radius circle centered on you</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You cause the plants within the area to be healthier and more fruitful. In addition to other benefits of healthy plants, this increases the crop yield for farms, depending on your success. If you cast it in the area of a @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.7yWXx3qC4eFNHhxD]{Blight}, <em>plant growth</em> attempts to counteract the <em>blight</em> instead of producing its usual effect.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Double the crop yield in the area, or increase the area to a 1-mile radius.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> Increase the crop yield in the area by one-third.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The ritual has no effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The flora in the area changes in an unanticipated way, determined by the GM but generally as contradictory to your true desires as possible (for instance, blighting crops when you would prefer to enrich them).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"plant-growth","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["plant","vitality","wood"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1 day"},"duration":{"value":"1 year","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":null},"counteraction":false,"ritual":{"primary":{"check":"Nature (expert)"},"secondary":{"casters":1,"checks":"Farming Lore or Survival"}}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.ZhJ8d9Uk4lwIx86b","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership